1958.description:
Space is a fascinating and captivating setting for adventure, so it's no surprise that the theme is popular in terms of both use and adventure framework. Therefore, today we are pleased to present to you an adventure called Aven ColonyIn this exciting adventure, you'll take on the role of a new colonization leader, achieving not only success but also significant results in terms of the colony's development and prosperity. You'll be settling a planet called Ivan Prime, located far from Earth. You'll need to organize resource collection, develop various technologies, and a host of other exciting elements that will allow you not only to expand your borders but also to explore entirely new places. To begin fulfilling your responsibilities, download the game now. Aven Colony via torrent for free. But don't rush, as you'll need to demonstrate your management skills and resource allocation skills for projects.

Game features:
- you will undergo detailed modeling and calculation of your capabilities, since maintaining a colony requires maximum calculations, for example, you will need to solve the problem of oxygen supply, organizing work places, food, etc.;
- there are dozens of different structures to choose from, ranging from a simple space tent to huge structures with the possibility of further improvement and upgrade;
- Ivan Prime has its own unique habitat, time of day and other interesting aspects, so you need to take these features into account and try to adapt to the living conditions so that people do not experience problems;
- a wide variety of individual drones will be available for colony management: some can purify the atmosphere, others maintain order, and still others are actively engaged in construction. Manage your robotic troops correctly to complete all assigned tasks;
- In addition to the dangerous environment in space, there are also dangerous viruses and infections that can affect infrastructure, such as "creepers," which attach themselves to the outer skin of a building and can damage it, piercing it with tentacles and continuing their parasitic influence until complete destruction. To eliminate them, it is necessary to create special, modified drones;
- the very nature of the cosmic habitat will also present you with its own surprises, for example, cosmic thunderstorms, dust tornadoes and other unpleasant cataclysms will arise, which require not only increased attention, but also expensive restoration;
- special attention is paid not only to air, but also to food; you need to carefully study the features of the planet and try to identify where it will be possible to place farms and production facilities for obtaining nutritious products;
- it is possible to modify your products through scientific influence;
- a convenient interface for monitoring what is happening in the colony, including about 12 sections;
- there are about ten unique social policies to choose from.

Aven Colony – This is a game for true fans of economic strategy games with an innovative approach to solving various problems. If you consider yourself such a player, now is the time to prove yourself. Enjoy the game!

